# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# SOTA KELLY VIDEO PIPELINE - Environment Variables
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Copy this to your .env file and fill in the values

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# REQUIRED - Core APIs
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Replicate - Image generation, LivePortrait, SadTalker, upscaling
# Get yours at: https://replicate.com/account/api-tokens
REPLICATE_API_TOKEN=r8_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# ElevenLabs - Kelly's voice
# Get yours at: https://elevenlabs.io/app/settings/api-keys
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# Kelly's trained voice ID (default is Kelly's voice)
ELEVENLABS_KELLY_VOICE_ID=wAdymQH5YucAkXwmrdL0

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PREMIUM - Higher Quality APIs (Optional but Recommended)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Sync Labs - Premium lip-sync (95%+ accuracy, 4K support)
# ⭐ HIGHLY RECOMMENDED - Biggest quality jump for the money
# Sign up at: https://sync.so
# Pricing: Free tier (5 min/mo), Pro $29/mo (60 min), Business $99/mo (300 min)
SYNC_LABS_API_KEY=sync_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# Hedra - Character-1 full face animation
# Full facial expressions, not just lips (eyes, brows, head movement)
# Sign up at: https://www.hedra.com
HEDRA_API_KEY=hedra_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# fal.ai - OmniHuman and advanced models
# Full body animation, cutting-edge models
# Sign up at: https://fal.ai
FAL_KEY=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# QUALITY TIERS (based on your API keys)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# Tier 0: iClone + AccuLips    - 99% (When artist delivers avatar)
# Tier 1: Sync Labs            - 95% lip-sync accuracy, 4K
# Tier 2: Hedra Character-1    - 90% full face animation
# Tier 3: OmniHuman            - 90% full body animation
# Tier 4: LivePortrait         - 85% audio-driven
# Tier 5: SadTalker + GFPGAN   - 70% baseline
#
# The pipeline auto-selects the best available based on your keys!
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# USAGE
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# Basic (uses best available):
#   npx tsx scripts/kelly-video-factory/sota-video-pipeline.ts --text "Hello!"
#
# Force specific tier:
#   npx tsx scripts/kelly-video-factory/sota-video-pipeline.ts --tier sync --text "Hello!"
#
# With 4K upscaling:
#   npx tsx scripts/kelly-video-factory/sota-video-pipeline.ts --upscale --text "Hello!"
#
# Run comparison test:
#   npx tsx scripts/kelly-video-factory/quality-comparison-test.ts
#
